      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLACK AMETHYST (1) settled down midfield and held her position to the line when finishing 4th (17.21) at this track. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Can bounce back. CULBURRA (2) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish second (19.85) at Angle Park in a Grade 5 over 342m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Must be included in calculations. PADUCAH (7) was popular in betting last start but disappointed when 2.75 lengths away in fourth (23.06). Was in the money the start prior. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Can do much better this time. CHAOTIC BOY (5) jumps at a shorter distance and still warrants respect.",
